theme = SubResource("Theme_msgcontent_scroll")
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0.6313726, 1, 0.6, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 16
text = "Welcome to Reckless!

Things are about to start flying, and it's up to you to handle them.

BLUE items: hold left click and swipe across them to slash.
RED items: click them to smash.
GREEN items: leave them alone! Hitting one costs you a heart.

Don't let blue or red items fall off the screen either, or you'll lose a heart. Clear every wave to finish a level and unlock the next one.

Every blue and red item you clear earns gems. Spend them at the Hiraya Shop on powerups like Shields and Double Gems, then pick one before you start a level.

New here? Open Settings and press Tutorial to practice first.

Good luck!"

